text = "You will be in control of three members of
The Frog Signal Corp

Every frog is equiped with a lantern to peel
back the gloom of the swamp, and each frog
gets to perform a couple actions per turn.

Explorer Frog:
Can emit a powerful croak to echolocate
mothmen hidden in the darkness.

Spotter Frog:
Holding a more powerful lantern, this quick frog can cover more ground.

Charger Frog:
Filled with dauntless spirit, the Charger frog is the only member
of the signal corps that can slay the dreaded mothmen with her Charge ability.

Be cautious with your facing at the end of each frog's turn -
as mothmen will only be held still while captivated
by the bright lights of the Signal Corps' lanters."
horizontal_alignment = 1
vertical_alignment = 1
